-### Voxel Buffer Memory Layout and Loop Optimization
-Optimizes in-core memory access patterns for regular grids. Choose when memory is sufficient and cache locality is critical. [Voxel Buffer Memory Layout and Loop Optimization](1598-voxel-buffer-memory-layout-and-loop-optimization.md)
-
-### Voxel Memory Bank Allocation and Miniblock Organization
-Organizes memory into banks to avoid bank conflicts in parallel rendering. Choose for GPU-based rendering of regular grids. [Voxel Memory Bank Allocation and Miniblock Organization](1638-voxel-memory-bank-allocation-and-miniblock-organization.md)
-
-### Volume Interleaving
-Interleaves data to improve spatial coherence and cache performance. Choose when working with structured data and limited cache size. [Volume Interleaving](2174-volume-interleaving.md)
